## Previously raised findings (review-round registry)

These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F1 | open | BLOCKING | flutter_app/lib/services/project_mount_flow.dart | 🚨 blocking platform islinux read unguarded — runtime crash on the shipped web build issamefolderpath evaluates platform islinux eagerly on every non exact comparison — the exact equality short circuit if root candidate return true fires first so any candidate that is not byte identical to the env root reaches this line dart final fold platform islinux string s s string s s tolowercase on flutter web dart io platform members throw unsupportederror platform operatingsystem at runtime this file is web compiled today it already imports dart io and flutter build web is green on main which is exactly why the same file guards its own platform read at project mount flow dart 206 dart if kisweb return false return platform ismacos platform isios chat screen dart 587 guards platform ismacos the same way reachable crash path web is a shipped target — ci yml flutter build web pages yml deploys it chat screen dart 473 — filesapppanel initialpath visiblefolderroot service env service currentsessioncwd — built with no kisweb gate whenever the files panel opens visiblefolderroot → issamefolderpath visible candidate → non exact pair → platform islinux → throw during build pre pr a non matching candidate returned null gate shows env cwd listing — graceful post pr a restored or cross device session whose recorded cwd differs from the live browser fs cwd crashes the files panel build the relocated container scenario this pr fixes for ios is precisely the recorded cwd ≠ live root shape that now throws on web suggested fix keep the exact equality contract degrade the fold on web dart final fold kisweb platform islinux string s s string s s tolowercase web folds identity — exact matches still return early and tail matches still fire when the case agrees no ios behavior changes a unit test with a fake kisweb the pattern agentservice tests already use main dart 1084 pins the web path |
| F2 | open | BLOCKING | flutter_app/lib/ui/widgets/wide_layout_shell_settings.dart | 🚨 blocking settings dock reserve reads the wrong context — bug 1 s settings leg is a silent no op on the phone the narrow shell s settings arm calls buildsettingspanel from narrowsectionsurface → buildnarrowbody while building the scaffold itself — so the context here is widelayoutshellstate context which sits above the shell scaffold dart final dockreserve isnarrow messengerfloatingdockinsets bottomof context state context — above the scaffold 0 0 but the inflated inset bottomof is designed to read only exists inside the scaffold body with extendbody true flutter adds a mediaquery widget whose bottom padding matches the height of the bottomnavigationbar above the scaffold s body scaffold extendbody docs api flutter dev flutter material scaffold extendbody html the state s context is an ancestor of the scaffold so it reads the raw view padding — on an iphone that is the 34pt home indicator which fails the mininflatedbottom 64 gate and returns 0 result on the phone settingscategorypanel bottomreserve 0 → the category list keeps its legacy 16pt bottom inset and its tail rows stay cut behind the 98pt floating dock — the exact bug 1 surface the ticket names chats activity local networks settings and the pr summary claims is reserved every other surface works because they call bottomof context inside their own build below the scaffold chatlistpanelstate localsessionspanelstate chatnetworkspanelstate activitylist activitydetail settings is the one call site above the inflation the new goldens pin chats activity keyboard only — settings has no golden consistent with this leg being inert suggested fix — mirror the other panels pass compact or the reserve into settingscategorypanel and resolve messengerfloatingdockinsets bottomof context inside its build where the context is below the shell scaffold and sees the inflated 98pt dart settings navigation dart — build final list listview padding edgeinsets fromltrb 8 toppadding 4 8 16 compact messengerfloatingdockinsets bottomof context 0 and keep buildsettingspanel passing compact isnarrow desktop stays at 0 the shell never builds the narrow scaffold there preserving byte identical desktop goldens then add the missing narrow settings golden to narrow layout shell ios bottom golden test dart so the leg is pinned like chats activity |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

