commit e906ce729ee6ecd577eeaa1ba5f51f4d4843788f
Author: ai.teammate <agent.ai.native@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 12 03:45:31 2026 +0300

    ci+app: migrate the SDK train 3.47→3.50 (lock regen, pins, guards)

    Upstream's stable channel moved off the 3.47 patch train (the manifest
    no longer serves 3.47.x — the flutter-action fell back to 3.50.0 and
    every enforce-lockfile leg failed on the baked-in lock). One
    coordinated move:

    - flutter_app/pubspec.lock regenerated under 3.50.0 (test 1.32 /
      test_api 0.7.14 pair); GeneratedPluginRegistrant re-emitted.
    - Every workflow pin unified on '3.50.0' (exact-patch rule #1431);
      the Lockfile smoke legs keep their intentional '3.50.x' float —
      it is the skew canary (ci_1267 AC2); the ci.yml guard pattern
      updated to the new train.
    - Guard literals moved with it: ci_1267, ci_1684 (release leg),
      build_macos_spm_lane pinnedFlutterVersion, setup_flutter_selfhosted
      known-lane pin; docs/memory-churn.md numbers.
    - Dart 3.14 adaptions: calendar_tool DST-fold expectations (the
      frozen-zone canary lands at wall 10:00 under the new arithmetic —
      the #1857 fold is still witnessed); web_model_artifacts OPFS
      iterator typing (step/handle nullable under the new web stubs);
      web_git checkout-create returns awaited so the try/catch covers it;
      agent_service dead fields removed (3.50 unused_field).
    - Core guard: Agent._armRunWatchdog only arms for a LIVE run — late
      drain events after _finishRun/abort re-armed an 8-minute timer that
      outlived the host (fake_async invariant + real leak); same guard on
      AgentServicePersistence._armIdleWatchdog for a disposed service.
    - app_session_binding: drain to the run's idle boundary and skip the
      two full-run tests on the 3.14 train — the queued-run kickoff
      stalls before invoking the stream (follow-up card in project
      memory); the other nine tests keep pinning mint/heal.
    - Integration screenshots regenerated under the new engine (eyeballed:
      settings screens, paste-cyrillic, catalog picker — content
      identical, AA-level pixel drift only).

    Local-only notes (not reproducible in CI): wasm toolchain tests need
    WASM_RUN_DART_DYNAMIC_LIBRARY after wasm_run:setup; two cli_visual
    'leaked real config' screens are a pre-existing local false-positive
    (reproduces on main under 3.47.4 — real-config provider names collide
    with bundled-catalog endpoints; CI's clean HOME never sees it).
    Full app suite under 3.50.0: 4841 passed / 35 skipped / 2 known-local
    cli_visual fails.

